    <p class="lede">Questions about the Gorge, a story, an artwork, permissions, or the website are welcome.</p>
    <p>Red River Gorge Hiker is operated by Red River Gorge Hiker, LLC. General public inquiries are handled through the brand’s information address.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="mailto:Info@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Info@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a></p>
    <section><h2>Photography and artwork permissions</h2><p>For photography or artwork permission requests, contact <a href="mailto:Info@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Info@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a> with the work title and intended use. Permission must be granted in writing by the applicable copyright holder or authorized rights representative.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Store orders</h2><p>For questions about a Store purchase, shipment, return, or existing order, Pixels / Fine Art America handles fulfillment and order support for the Red River Gorge Hiker Store.</p><p><a class="button" href="https://store.redrivergorgehiker.com/contactus.html?tab=contactus" data-store-item-type="support">Store Customer Service</a></p></section>
